<title>JAPAN: Yachiyo Industry -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yachiyo Industry -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 67.42		vs	   54.68</p>
<p> Operating	    1.11		vs	  668    million</p>
<p> Current	    975    million	  vs	  408    million</p>
<p> Net		  358    million	  vs	  206    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.91 yen	  vs	    8.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yachiyo Industry Co Ltd makes car parts.</p>
</text>
